    "# ♻️ Triagem de Resíduos — Notebook corrigido para Colab\n",
    "\n",
    "Este notebook contém as etapas de: conferir GPU, enviar dataset, (opcional) preparar TACO, treinar com Transfer Learning (MobileNetV2) e — importante — uma sequência segura para converter o modelo para TensorFlow.js sem quebrar o runtime.\n",
    "\n",
    "INSTRUÇÕES IMPORTANTES:\n",
    "1. Salve todo trabalho não salvo antes de executar células que reinstalam pacotes (se tiverem).\n",
    "2. Se o runtime foi reiniciado, recarregue/execute as células que leem do disco (por exemplo, carregar modelo salvo) antes de converter.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1) Conferir GPU"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "!nvidia-smi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2) Enviar o dataset (faça o upload do ZIP)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from google.colab import files\n",
    "import os, zipfile\n",
    "\n",
    "uploaded = files.upload()\n",
    "zip_name = list(uploaded.keys())[0]\n",
    "with zipfile.ZipFile(zip_name, 'r') as z:\n",
    "    z.extractall('/content/upload_extracted')\n",
    "print('Extraido em /content/upload_extracted')\n",
    "!find /content/upload_extracted -maxdepth 4 -type d"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Localiza automaticamente a pasta que contem as 6 subpastas de classes\n",
    "import os\n",
    "CLASSES = [\"cardboard\", \"glass\", \"metal\", \"paper\", \"plastic\", \"trash\"]\n",
    "candidate = None\n",
    "for root, dirs, files_ in os.walk('/content/upload_extracted'):\n",
    "    if all(c in dirs for c in CLASSES):\n",
    "        candidate = root\n",
    "        break\n",
    "assert candidate is not None, \"Nao encontrei uma pasta com as 6 subpastas esperadas. Confira o ZIP enviado.\"\n",
    "DATASET_DIR = candidate\n",
    "print(\"Dataset encontrado em:\", DATASET_DIR)\n",
    "for c in CLASSES:\n",
    "    n = len(os.listdir(os.path.join(DATASET_DIR, c)))\n",
    "    print(f\"  {c}: {n} imagens\")\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
